From: Antigravity <antigravity@google.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 19:24:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: Add support for BOE JD9366 (GA36-MB v1.2)

Adds the driver for the BOE JD9366 MIPI-DSI panel used in the GA36-MB v1.2.

Signed-off-by: Antigravity <antigravity@google.com>
